# Additional Configuration
# 
# To add more reviewers for specific areas:
# 1. Add GitHub usernames or team names (with @)
# 2. Use team names like @safle/security-team for organization teams
# 3. More specific patterns override general ones
# 
# Example patterns:
# *.sol                                  @security-expert
# /contracts/security/**                 @security-team @audit-team
